Subject: [PATCH V2 3/6] arm64: LLVMLinux: Calculate current_thread_info from current_stack_pointer
Date: Tue, 26 Aug 2014 21:29:31 -0700
Message-Id: <1409113774-3172-4-git-send-email-behanw@converseincode.com>
